WEBVTT

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.010
Previously on <i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.390
The school idol competition,
the Love Live, has finally begun.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.430
We were given a theme for the regional
prelims, which happened to be rap!

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.180
♬ Sumire Heanna is my name ♬

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.150
♬ I'm an AB and being
a shrine priestess is my game. ♬

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:31.400
We discovered Sumire-<i>chan</i>'s new talent
and decided to let her be the center.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.490
The center...

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.280
Please reach!

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.200
Sumire...

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.200
That's the first time
you actually said my name.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.950
Today's finally the day
they announce the results!

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.330
How will things end up for Liella!?

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.040
"Once More, at That Place"

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Please, Lord...

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:49.670
Well? Well, how did we do?!

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:50.920
It's noon.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.510
The results should be up.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:55.300
Don't worry! We did our best!

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.050
Okay, here we go.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:01.260
Eight groups will be getting through
the regional prelims.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:04.020
Entry number 1, Sunny Passion.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:04.930
Of course.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:06.140
No surprise.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.100
And...

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.690
Entry number 21, Neo Mutant Girls.

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:14.860
Entry number 62, from Asakusa, Sky Lovely.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:18.570
Entry number 70,
from Kagurazaka, Dash Gumi.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:19.740
Entry number...

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.450
Come on!

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:23.700
Huh?

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:27.710
The computer froze!

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:30.340
Oh, come on! Don't leave us hanging!

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.500
Come on! Move! Work!

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.010
Perhaps it's because so many people are
trying to access the site at once.

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:37.720
I'll try using my phone.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:43.640
Huh? A message from Sunny Passion?

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.350
"Congratulations"
"Let's both have
wonderful performances!!"

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.350
"Congratulations"...

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:47.520
Does that mean...

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.480
Oh, it's working again.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:55.030
We did it!

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:01.240
<i>You can't stop real dreams</i>

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:06.910
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:11.170
"Love Live! Superstar!!"

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:28.020
<i>Before we knew it,</i>
<i>we found something that we loved</i>

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:31.520
<i>Let these feelings reach you</i>

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.190
<i>We've made up our minds, we're serious!</i>

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:36.990
<i>I wonder what we can do</i>

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.900
<i>The sky's so bright</i>

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:44.330
<i>Let's look up at it</i>
<i>and sing our hearts out</i>

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:48.410
<i>Doesn't having something you want to do</i>

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:51.080
<i>Make every day fun?</i>

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:56.170
<i>Do you feel that way, too?</i>

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.470
<i>Ah, we've been waiting for this moment</i>

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.510
<i>This encounter is where we start</i>

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:06.890
<i>Our dreams are drawn together,</i>
<i>and it all begins</i>

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:12.690
<i>We realized our true desires and now,</i>
<i>we can't be stopped</i>

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:18.070
<i>Our hearts are about to start running</i>

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:23.910
<i>As fast as they can run</i>

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:25.450
"Congratulations for getting into
the Tokyo tournament!!"

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:27.410
"Congratulations for getting into
the Tokyo tournament!!"

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:27.410
Congratulations!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:31.250
We were all saying how we knew you'd
make it through the regional prelims!

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.710
Sumire-<i>chan</i>, you were so cool!

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.170
Everyone who saw you
up close became a fan!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.670
O-Of course! Who do you think I am?

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:45.010
Says the giant isopod who was
chickening out right until we got onstage.

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:45.890
Shut up!

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:49.600
All of you working so hard
gave us strength, too!

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.770
You're the hope of our school.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:56.520
If there's anything we can do
to help you out, let us know!

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.020
Thanks!

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:01.150
This is an announcement for
the members of the School Idol Club.

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:05.950
The members of the School Idol Club
are to come to my office after school.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.580
I repeat.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:12.790
The members of the School Idol Club
are to come to my office after school.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.540
Are you getting an award?!

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:17.840
Hopefully, but she sounded sorta mad.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.590
I wonder what's going on.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.340
It's all my fault.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:25.340
Ren-<i>chan</i>...

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.720
You? What could you have possibly done?

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:33.640
Well, the other day when I was in
the club room, the computer was on, and...

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.890
Honestly...

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:37.810
"A Forbidden World"

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.280
"A Forbidden World"

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.070
"A Forbidden World"

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.320
"A Forbidden World"

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:54.040
Curiosity got the better of me
and I clicked it...

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:58.380
How could I have done such a thing?
I'm the student council president.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:01.050
Oh, I fail. I'll be suspended.
Kicked out of school.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:02.170
My life is now over...

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:05.760
Yeah, I don't think anyone
found that out...

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:08.430
Yes?

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:10.100
Please excuse us.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:11.600
Come in.

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:15.980
What's wrong? Did you eat something bad?

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.650
N-No. It's just...

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.070
I'm so terribly sorry!

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:22.610
I, Ren Hazuki, despite being
the student council president,

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:24.900
could not contain my curiosity and looked!

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:27.240
What are you talking about?

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:30.200
The reason I had you stop by
is because I received this.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:33.040
It's from Shibuya-<i>san </i>and
Arashi-<i>san</i>'s grade school.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.870
They want you to sing there.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:38.250
Our grade school?

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:42.840
Yes. They wanted you to sing
as school idols for their students

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:45.050
since you came from that school.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.800
Oh, I see...

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:49.760
That's magnificent! Let us go immediately!

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:53.060
So I can tell them "yes," then?

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:53.930
--Oh, thank goodness...

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:55.480
--Is something wrong?
--Oh, thank goodness...

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:59.810
Oh, no. It's a very lovely request.

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:05.780
Everyone, keep your balance.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:09.240
Keke-<i>san</i>! You should be able
to do this by now!

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:10.990
Just ten more minutes!

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.210
We're next, aren't we?

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:28.340
Don't worry!

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.430
Kanon-<i>chan</i>...

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:32.760
Singing isn't scary. It's fun!

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:38.140
We all practiced so hard
because we love to sing, right?

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:44.820
If we sing with those feelings,
it'll get through to the audience.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:49.860
These fun feelings will get through
to people all over the world!

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.660
So let's sing! And have fun!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:59.620
Next up, we have the Aoyama Minami
Elementary School choir.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:19.600
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.940
The song started!

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:26.780
Well.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:29.110
I've got work, so...

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:31.200
Okay. Do your best!

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.360
Hey!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.160
Hey!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.870
That must be difficult,
right after practice.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.700
But at least she seems to be having fun.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.330
"Are you free right now?"

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:43.040
"Don't tell Kanon-<i>chan</i>"

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:44.880
"Meet up at the <i>takoyaki </i>place"

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.000
What's wrong?

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.710
N-Nothing at all!

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:51.050
Bye, now.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.550
Farewell!

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:54.180
Goodbye!

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.930
So what did you want to talk about?

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:02.980
And you wanting to keep it a secret
from Kanon is pretty unexpected.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:04.060
Yeah...

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:07.190
This must be about your grade school.

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:08.780
She fainted?

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:13.740
Yeah. That was the first incident
where Kanon-<i>chan </i>couldn't sing.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:18.740
I see. So you're worried that might
happen again if she stands on that stage?

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.160
I think she'll be okay, but...

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:25.250
Yes! Kanon was able to
sing on stage with me.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:28.960
She's been able to sing ever since!

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:32.170
Actually, she's been rather
proactive about singing.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.930
Yeah.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:38.390
I know that, but it's just...

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:44.390
Kanon-<i>chan </i>can be
really sensitive at times.

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:52.530
But you know, if that's all it takes
for her to not be able to sing,

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:55.490
she probably won't be able to
sing at the Love Live.

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:59.450
I hate that I'm agreeing with you,
but Sumire is right.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:00.700
Yeah.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.460
Then why don't we all
go there together before?

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:08.250
We can see how Kanon-<i>san </i>reacts.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.210
Go there before...

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.720
Thank you so much for dropping by.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.130
Well, we live close by.

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:22.430
School idols, was it? So many
of our students love them.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:23.600
Really?

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:25.060
That makes me so happy.

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:30.650
This takes me back! This was the classroom
Kanon-<i>chan </i>and I were in!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.070
The desks are so tiny.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:35.280
I guess we were this small
in grade school.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.660
You would always dance here, Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.990
And you would always
sing here, Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:43.580
Did I?

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.500
"Choral Competition"
"Let's win this!!"

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.250
Let's go.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.290
Yeah.

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:54.670
You'll be singing onstage
at this auditorium the day of.

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:56.340
It's bigger than I thought...

00:09:56.340 --> 00:10:00.300
Of course, it is!
All of the students will be here!

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.600
Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:07.190
Want to try standing on the stage?

00:10:09.940 --> 00:10:11.270
This is...

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:30.960
Kanon-<i>chan</i>, try singing a little.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:36.510
It's just practice. We should do that
even a little since we're here.

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:37.630
Right...

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:48.600
Sorry, give me a second.

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:52.650
Kanon...

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:57.400
Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:06.040
Everyone...

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:26.010
<i>Love Live! Superstar!!</i>

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:28.600
One, two, three, four...

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:29.730
Sumire-<i>chan</i>, you're too fast.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:30.810
I know.

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:31.940
Ren-<i>chan</i>, you're holding back too much.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:32.810
Understood.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:34.020
Okay!

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:38.490
This choreography is pretty hard.

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:40.450
We're going to be performing
at the Tokyo tournament.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:44.450
I put my all into this choreography,
so we won't be outdone.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.870
Do you think we'll win?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:49.700
I think we totally can, with all of us!

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.210
There's trouble!

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:53.080
Hey, we started practice already.

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.250
The theme for the Tokyo tournament
has been announced!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:58.250
Theme?

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.840
The theme for
the Tokyo tournament is this!

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:02.220
"Tokyo Tournament Theme"
"Vocal Solos"

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:02.220
Solos!

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:06.220
"Tokyo Tournament Theme"
"Vocal Solos"

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:06.220
Make sure your song has a solo part!

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:08.720
Another difficult assignment.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:11.560
Meaning pure vocal talent
will be expected.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:12.940
Yeah.

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:15.730
Stare...

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:23.360
No one's going to argue here.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.570
What?

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:26.370
I guess it'll be up to Kanon-<i>san</i>.

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:30.080
I would've stepped in
if it was a different assignment.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.250
But...

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.710
The reason Liella! is here is because
you sang back then, Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.960
Because you responded
to Keke-<i>chan</i>'s feelings.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.510
Chi-<i>chan</i>...

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:44.050
There's no one else.

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:54.390
This is wonderful. Kanon was able to sing,
and if the assignment is a solo,

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:56.650
we can let her talent shine!

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.060
Yeah...

00:12:58.060 --> 00:12:59.730
Is something wrong?

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.410
What...

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:08.530
I guess I put too much
mochi in it. My bad.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:12.000
No problem. It's all the same
when I eat it.

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:13.290
Sorry.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:19.130
It tastes good, though!

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:25.050
This isn't okay!
We can't leave things like this.

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:28.640
Because we were there?

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:34.480
Yeah. I think Kanon-<i>chan </i>was able to sing
because we were all there.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.140
Really?

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:40.570
Did Kanon-<i>chan </i>say something to you
when you two performed?

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:45.360
I think, "I can sing...
because I'm not alone!"

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.360
I knew it.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.820
Then...

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:51.740
All of our performances since then
and the other day at the school, too.

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:54.790
It's because we were all there.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:58.500
I think she was able to sing
because she didn't feel alone.

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:02.170
Is that a bad thing?

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:06.630
I think it's lovely being able to sing
because you have friends.

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:10.800
I thought that, too. But...

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:14.350
Does that mean she can really sing though?

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:18.730
Maybe her anxiety really won't go away...

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:22.440
This is a difficult situation.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:26.780
I mean, I get what you're saying...
So now what?

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:30.700
Yeah, we might get turned down, but...

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.080
Director!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:36.120
This may sound like
a slightly personal request...

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.370
Huh? You do?

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:43.590
Yeah, my family told me I have to be there
no matter what that day.

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:44.880
I see.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:48.380
I also have something very important
that I must attend to.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:50.090
As do I...

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:54.100
My family also insisted that
I help out at the shrine that day.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.730
What? Wait, wait. Hang on!

00:14:56.730 --> 00:15:00.900
Then it's not going to be Liella! anymore.
It's just going to be me?

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:02.190
You've got a point.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:05.610
Yeah, so we contacted our grade school,

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:09.990
and they were hoping you could
still do it, Kanon-<i>chan</i>.

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:14.450
Actually, the kids at the school
really want to hear you sing.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:15.580
But...

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:18.120
Is that a no?

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:23.170
See you...

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:27.010
If anything comes up, just call.
I'll be there to support you.

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:30.340
I will also be waiting around the clock!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:34.800
Thanks. I guess I'll go home and practice.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.510
Hey!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:41.350
This is mean.
I feel really bad about this.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:42.400
Yeah.

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:44.190
You've been friends
since you were little, haven't you?

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:47.400
You've definitely got a point, but yeah...

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:50.400
You see.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:55.080
I thought I couldn't do anything
when I was little.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:59.410
I thought I'd fail at everything
and gave up.

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:03.460
There's no way you can't do something
before you even try!

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:04.670
But...

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:08.760
I'll do this with you,
so let's do our best. Ready, and!

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:16.550
Her smile... Her smile gives me life.

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:22.770
I could relax and be confident. It's a
smile that truly makes everyone happy.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:27.690
That's the kind of smile Kanon-<i>chan </i>has.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:32.650
So if we're able to
get that Kanon-<i>chan </i>back...

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:37.410
If Kanon-<i>chan </i>is able to
regain those feelings

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:40.200
after all the hardships
and failures she faced...

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:42.460
She'll be unstoppable.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:43.920
Chisato...

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.790
I'm not just talking about the Love Live.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:48.290
We'd be able to be
the best in the world... no.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:52.130
The best in the galaxy,
just like Sumire-<i>chan </i>says.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:57.350
I... Chisato Arashi, believe in her.
I believe in Kanon Shibuya!

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.600
Aria.

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:05.480
What was I like when I was little?

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.810
Where'd that come from?

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:10.650
I just wanted to know suddenly.

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.570
You were super passionate,
loud, and annoying.

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:17.450
You were always telling people they can
do things if they try or to do their best.

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:20.580
What are you, some hyped-up sportscaster?

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:22.410
Jeez, did you have to go that far?!

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:25.330
But you know... I didn't hate it!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:34.170
We ended up coming after all.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:36.050
I was so worried
that I couldn't sleep a wink.

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.470
Hey! She'll see us!

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:38.600
That hurts!

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:40.680
--It does not!
--Kanon-<i>chan</i>...

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:46.480
I can't see! Move!

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:48.480
Go over there!

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.030
Kanon-<i>chan</i>...

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.740
Chi-<i>chan</i>...

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:56.950
What's wrong?

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.740
Thanks.

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:01.660
I was able to sing because
I had all of you with me.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.910
I thought that was okay.

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:07.750
But it's not.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:10.960
In order to support others
or help them out,

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:16.340
I need to do this on my own,
just like you did, Chi-<i>chan</i>.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:20.300
Yeah... But you're not alone.

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:23.970
The Kanon-<i>chan </i>from the past is with you.

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:30.440
The Kanon-<i>chan </i>who wanted her song
to be heard all around the world.

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:34.110
I...

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:35.240
Hey!

00:18:38.070 --> 00:18:39.570
Don't worry!

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:42.530
Singing isn't scary. It's fun!

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:45.620
Singing is so much fun!

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:52.040
We all practiced so hard
because we love to sing, right?

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.210
So let's sing! And have fun!

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:55.460
Yeah!

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:02.800
I'm scared...

00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:06.600
I don't know why... but I'm scared.

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:19.860
That's right. I was scared.
Even back then.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.160
But even then, I...

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:29.410
It's okay. You love to sing, right?

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:06.620
♬ I had always kept
what I liked the most ♬

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:10.750
♬ Preciously locked away ♬

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:15.040
♬ How can I make it come true? ♬

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:20.050
♬ I didn't know,
so I couldn't move forward ♬

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:23.550
♬ Then the opportunity had suddenly ♬

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:27.760
♬ Presented itself in front of me ♬

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:31.850
♬ Even though it wasn't
exactly what I had imagined, ♬

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:36.270
♬ I gently reached out
with both of my hands ♬

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:40.240
♬ It's that first,
awkward step that you take ♬

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:44.990
♬ That changes the world
around you brilliantly ♬

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:48.910
♬ What lies ahead? What can I do? ♬

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:54.000
♬ I'll show some courage
and move forward ♬

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:59.880
♬ I'm not the small, little me
that I was yesterday ♬

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:03.840
♬ I started playing my dream ♬

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:08.140
♬ Once the curtain rises,
what lies beyond is ♬

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:12.100
♬ The stage I always saw in my heart ♬

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:16.810
♬ Even the things I thought
I'd never be able to do ♬

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:20.860
♬ See? They can come true
if I take that first step ♬

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:25.160
♬ I'm going to let this
sparkling hope resonate ♬

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:33.540
♬ Now spread to the ends of
the earth, my symphony ♬

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:46.970
Kanon-<i>chan</i>...

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:48.800
Hey, whoa!

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:52.060
Kanon-<i>chan</i>!

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:53.390
Chi-<i>chan</i>!

00:22:02.730 --> 00:22:06.030
I really think we have
a chance of winning.

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:08.110
We're going to win at the Love Live!

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:11.530
Of course, we are!

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:14.580
Because Liella! is the best.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:18.210
Nice to meet you all. We're Liella!

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:24.130
Please listen to our song!

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:28.930
<i>The future is calling to us</i>

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:31.760
<i>Like the wind</i>

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:37.980
<i>No one knows what the future holds for us</i>

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:42.320
<i>Even then, we want to move forward</i>

00:22:42.320 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>Because we don't want to have any regrets</i>

00:22:45.820 --> 00:22:49.450
<i>You can't hold down our hearts</i>

00:22:49.450 --> 00:22:53.620
<i>Let's all be free</i>

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:57.080
<i>We're not going to give up!</i>

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:00.670
<i>Because we decided that</i>

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>We'll cry, laugh, and do our best</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>We all want to surpass our limits</i>

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>It's important to believe</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:15.850
<i>And once we told ourselves that</i>

00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:22.860
<i>Let's try to go even further</i>

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:30.610
<i>We may be small, but we have big dreams</i>

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:37.700
<i>We won't give in, now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:45.300
<i>Let's fly the best we can,</i>
<i>now, let's fly together</i>

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:50.760
Next time, "Song for All."
